/* Set TikTok ads dashboard date range. Sync IIFE for ziniao page exec.
 * Placeholders replaced by PowerShell: __DATE_MODE__ (yesterday|today), __ACTION__ (open|pick|status)
 * No // comments (minified to one line). */
